        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Bridge Smoke Alpha\n\nThis graph should expose a workspace bridge aperture to **Bridge Smoke Beta**.\n\nWith Beta closed, the source aperture should be capped and actionable. With Beta open alongside, the workspace should derive a corridor between the two graph frames."
        }
